cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "crossy-visuals: Reusable diagrams for the Crossys (OCMDP, MaCHeCO, JNL)"
abstract: >-
  Presentation and paper graphics for the Crossys -- the crosswalk components
  of NFDI4Objects (the Object Core Metadata Profile, the Material Cultural
  Heritage Crosswalk Ontology, and the Junction Node Layer) and the
  CrossyBase curation environment. Generated by pure-Python scripts and
  rasterised with resvg-py, no external CLI tools required. Sibling
  repository to chublets-software/chublets-visuals and
  FDOx-squirrel/fdox-visuals, same house pattern, own palette.
